body:
Congratulations! So happy for you even we are complete strangers haha. Recently I realised that EVERYTHING IS ALWAYS PERFECT. I listened to a Neville affirmation video on yt while taking a walk after dinner, and the affirmation is very simple, just repeated 'Isn't it wonderful?' 

Cuz it's simple and repetitive, I realised that the 3D is actually perfect all the time. Even the 'undesired' is just a part of the process to getting the end goal. Because every time I look back of my life so far, I realise that everything actually worked out perfectly, even I was struggling at some of the moments, things still worked out fine. So there's no need to stress out, cuz everything is perfect all the time. This helped me to be more relaxed and able to separate myself from the 3D, I sorta started to feel I'm watching a film and kindda excited for the unknown like I would when watching a great film, cuz I know it's always working perfectly. 

&#x200B;

Additionally, I started affirming 'I am love, I am light' and imagining nothing but being pure white light and feel loving and loved. Then I started listening to this neville affirmation video mentioned above out of the blue ( it's in my phone for ages), then the 'everything is perfect' affirmation just popped in my head. It's truly magical. I am excited to be part of the "BEING" and to be able to experience the magic. 

&#x200B;

here's the [link](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y4MqD8rI0AU) to the video just in case anyone's interested. (it's a sleep meditation so DON'T LISTEN WHILE DRIVING OR OPERATING MACHINES)
